WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.700
16 people drowned in Bihar while collecting festival river water, and police say more may die. This is Omni View Asia Pacific, Episode 20. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. The Hindu reports those deaths came on Sunday, October 11, Day 1 of Desera, which runs 10 days and ends on Vijaya Dashami, Tuesday, October 20. People were taking river water for Kalashthapana, a ceremonial pot set up for prayers to Durga, a senior officer at Patna Police Headquarters,

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.720
officers, who asked not to be named, said on Monday that recent flooding had lifted

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.360
the rivers and that people had walked into deep water.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.060
Police officials said most drowning reports came from Muzafrpor, Darbanga, and Sita-Marhi.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.640
That officer said three death incidents were reported from those districts, and one

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:53.420
death each in Samasthapur, Shiohar, Bojpur, Saran, Begisarai, Nawada, and Rotas.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:59.140
In Bagaha, under Rom Nagar police station in West Champagrin, Sarvesh Kumar and Neuraj

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.200
Kumar, both under 15, died by electrocution on the way to a river to collect the water.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.540
Across the region, the Hindu reports the Joint Tribes' Council Manipur set a 48-hour

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:14.480
deadline on Sunday, and called it non-negotiable, for the return of the severed head of Ajahn

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.920
Boar, who was 52.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:21.440
He was allegedly killed in a suspected militant attack on Makui Ashang village in Kangpok

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.440
be district on Saturday. His headless body reached Jawaharlal Nehru Institute of Medical

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:32.140
Sciences in Imfall on Sunday night for a post-mortem. After a video spread on Saturday that appeared

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:37.160
to show his head among heavily armed militants in camouflage. The council said no examination

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:40.620
of the body will start until the head is back so he can be buried with dignity,

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:45.480
and it said it will not let state officials damage the remains any further while militants

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:50.000
keep the head as a trophy. It holds the state and central governments directly responsible,

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.620
school, and it warned of what it called the most stringent measures if the head is not

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:54.760
found and brought back.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:59.400
Chief Minister Y. Kim Chon-Sing condemned the killings and asked authorities to act

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.600
at once to restore peace and protect citizens.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:06.480
A new South Wales parliamentary inquiry has heard claims that Redeemer Baptist School and

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.220
Sydney put students in the same beds as teachers on compulsory camps, the Sydney Morning

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:11.920
Herald reports.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:17.060
Emma Hughes, a former student who did not belong to the church, wrote that Cabin Space

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:22.060
ran short in 1998, and that her teacher made pupils take turns sharing a bed each night.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:26.980
She wrote that she herself was not harmed, yet she called the arrangement plainly inappropriate

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:27.700
and unsafe.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:34.000
Edward Garth, also a former student, said that in June 2015, at age 12, he was in a school

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.880
homestay with a 14-year-old and a 15-year-old from overseas when he saw principal Jonathan

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.540
Cannon leave a bathroom and cross a living room naked.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.880
A room cannon knew the students were using.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:48.920
Garth said he told Cannon's brother, an elder who also sat on the school board and was

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:49.320
scolded.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:54.100
A spokesperson for Redeemer said the school has no record that the alleged incident involving

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.040
Cannon took place.

